    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated in the sought-after area of The Glebe, Ballina, this attractive detached family home enjoys a convenient and desirable location, within easy reach of Ballina town centre and a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and recreational facilities.\n\nThe property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an ideal home for families and first-time buyers. \n\nExtending to approximately 113.8 sq. m., the accommodation provides excellent living space with a practical layout designed for comfortable modern living.\n\nThe ground floor comprises of a welcoming entrance porch, a spacious living room, a versatile dining room/home office, and a light-filled kitchen overlooking the rear garden.\nThe kitchen provides access to the property's private garden which includes a large garage.\n\nUpstairs, the property features four generously sized bedrooms, providing ample space for family living, guests or home working, together with a modern family bathroom.\n\nAs a detached house, the property offers excellent privacy and outdoor potential, with space surrounding the home and opportunities to create an attractive garden and outdoor living area.\n\nWith its generous accommodation, four bedrooms, two reception rooms and two bathrooms, this property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in The Glebe, Ballina.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
