        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.03m x 1.16m\nTiled floor\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.28m x 1.87m\nTimber floor\n\nLiving Room - 4.06m x 6.00m\nTimber floor, open fireplace\n\nDining Room - 3.25m x 4.47m\nTimber floor\n\nKitchen - 2.72m x 4.63m\nTiled floor, fitted units\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.40m x 3.01m\nCarpet floor\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.40m x 2.85m\nCarpet floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.46m x 2.40m\nCarpet floor, fitted wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.16m x 3.40m\nCarpet floor, fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite - 1.59m x 2.17m\nW.H.B, electric shower, fully tiled\n\nLanding - 1.38m x 2.27m\nCarpet floor\n\nBathroom - 3.05m x 1.87m\nW.H.B, electric shower, fully tiled\n\n"
